### ============================
### 采购管理测试
### ============================

### 登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token);
%}


### ============================
### 供应商
### ============================

### 供应商列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/suppliers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 新增供应商
POST http://localhost:8080/api/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "测试供应商",
  "contact": "王五",
  "phone": "13800000000",
  "address": "测试地址"
}


### ============================
### 采购单
### ============================

### 创建采购单（DRAFT）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/purchase/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "supplierId": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 20,
      "price": 200.00
    },
    {
      "productId": 2,
      "quantity": 50,
      "price": 45.00
    }
  ]
}

> {%
    client.global.set("purchaseOrderId", response.body.data.id);
%}


### 查询采购单列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/purchase/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 查询采购单详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/purchase/orders/{{purchaseOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 完成入库（库存增加）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/purchase/orders/{{purchaseOrderId}}/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 验证库存（库存应增加）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 重复入库 → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/purchase/orders/{{purchaseOrderId}}/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
